CONSCIENCE CLAUSE

The rights granted above are withheld from any person or organization that:

  1. develops, operates, or materially supports mass-surveillance systems
     targeting populations without their informed consent; or

  2. provides products or services to military or defense customers where
     those products or services contribute to the planning or execution of
     armed force, including weapons targeting, intelligence collection for
     strikes, or battlefield logistics; or

  3. acts as a contractor, subsidiary, or front entity carrying out either
     of the above on behalf of another party.

An individual contributor who personally worked in such roles retains their
rights under this license so long as they do not use the Software to continue
that work. The clause targets what the Software is used FOR -- never ancestry,
nationality, belief, or lawful past employment unrelated to such systems.

